  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "甘味と　酸味と　塩味の　調味料。マッチする食材が　意外と　多く使い勝手が　よい　食材なのだ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "단맛과 신맛과 짠맛이 나는 조미료. 어울리는 식재료가 은근히 많아서 아무 때나 쓰기 좋은 식재료다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "帶有甜味、酸味和鹹味的調味料。能搭配的食材意外地多，是很好使用的百搭食材。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condiment au goût sucré, acide et salé. Sa nature versatile en fait un accompagnement agréable pour une quantité surprenante d’ingrédients.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dieses Würzmittel ist eine sehr vielseitige Zutat, da es süße, saure sowie salzige Geschmacksnoten vereint und so mit den unterschiedlichsten Belägen harmoniert.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Gracias a que combina dulzor, acidez y un toque salado, es un ingrediente muy versátil que casa muy bien con muchos otros.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condimento dolce, aspro e salato. Si abbina bene a una sorprendente varietà di ingredienti e per questo è molto versatile.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A condiment offering very sweet and very tart flavor. It goes well with more ingredients than you’d expect, making it a convenient go-to.",
